WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:06.112
Spark SQL does not execute your text directly in one
simple step It

00:00:06.138 --> 00:00:11.954
parses the SQL resolves tables and columns optimizes
the logical plan and creates a physical

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:17.635
plan The physical plan includes operators such as
scans filters

00:00:17.753 --> 00:00:23.400
joins aggregates sorts and exchanges Exchanges often
indicate data

00:00:23.413 --> 00:00:23.940
movement
